 "notes": [
  "Each claim has one Claimant: (:Claimant)-[:FILED]->(:Claim).",
  "A claim has many ScoreSnapshot nodes (its score over time). The current score is the snapshot with the biggest as_of_date.",
  "Claims of the SAME Incident ((:Claim)-[:ARISES_FROM]->(:Incident)) are one accident. A link between them is not network evidence. Leave such pairs out when you look for links between claims.",
  "Dates are Neo4j date values. Compare them with date('2024-01-31').",
  "Finding: value is the rating, confidence is Low, Medium or High, quote is the exact text, and page_number with (:Finding)-[:FOUND_IN]->(:Document) gives the source.",
  "Community: a group of claims joined by strong links: (:Claim)-[:IN_COMMUNITY]->(:Community).",
  "Return plain values (claim_id, names, counts), never whole nodes. Always end with LIMIT."
 ]
}